# BMad and agent-skill installs: the trees are installer-generated and
# regenerated on every install, so they are not reviewed and not committed.
# Two exceptions are genuinely ours and stay versioned: the team config
# override, and each skill's customize.toml.
# Planning artifacts under _bmad-output/ are work product — NOT ignored.
# _bmad/render/.gitignore also stays tracked: it is the installer's own
# keep-the-dir stub, and a nested .gitignore outranks this file for paths
# under it, so it cannot be excluded from here.
_bmad/**
!_bmad/**/
!_bmad/custom/config.toml
!_bmad/custom/bmad-build-auto.toml
.agents/
.claude/skills/**
!.claude/skills/**/
!.claude/skills/*/customize.toml
.claude/worktrees/
__pycache__/

# bmad-driver runtime state/logs and checkpoint approval markers (scripts/bmad-driver.py)
.scratch/.driver/
.scratch/*/stories/*.approved
